# Curi API

See `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md` and `docs/DATA.md`.

- Validate request/response with Zod.
- Enforce plan limits and auth in Route Handlers.
- Lesson completion idempotent on `(user_id, course_id, lesson_index)`.
- Never expose `SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY` or `PERPLEXITY_API_KEY` to client.
- TDD: `*.test.ts` colocated with handler or domain module.
